"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-04-07T16:27:37Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T22:49:43Z","closed_at":"2026-04-01T23:14:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105122","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105122","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105122.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105122.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-01T23:14:16Z"},"body":"This was due to the antialiasing feather not being compensated for when drawing the line. The feather makes the line appear thicker, so we have to reduce the line width to compensate.\r\n\r\nThis also affected filled circles and rectangles, which are now compensated for by adjusting their radius and size respectively.\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105027.\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n*Click to view at full size. All screenshots taken from the MRP of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105027 with the Compatibility rendering method.*\r\n\r\n### Lines\r\n\r\n*Note that stretched ellipses/arcs using `draw_set_transform()` are not compensated for by the current antialiasing code (this is possible but nontrivial). The MRP uses those instead of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/85080, which make use of the antialiasing fix implemented in this PR.*\r\n\r\nNot Antialiased | Antialiased Before | Antialiased After\r\n-|-|-\r\n![Screenshot_20250407_181643](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e9aa79f8-8bcb-412f-b35e-5b38534fb4fd) | ![Screenshot_20250407_181656](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eaf5ae7e-36da-421c-9545-287f11e650d8) | ![Screenshot_20250407_181710](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ba757eb5-7b68-4516-97da-f0cafc1d23f1)\r\n\r\n### Rectangles\r\n\r\n*Note that StyleBoxFlat antialiasing is not affected by this issue, so this PR doesn't change it in any way.*\r\n\r\nNot Antialiased | Antialiased Before | Antialiased After\r\n-|-|-\r\n![Screenshot_20250407_181644](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f22b5f39-b67d-4e49-8033-f86cf1c15ed9) | ![Screenshot_20250407_181657](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9f3f8cf5-033a-41fb-846b-eaae553461b5) | ![Screenshot_20250407_181712](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3b7877f0-3ea8-4a2f-9053-3162bb1f4667)\r\n\r\n### Polygons\r\n\r\nNot Antialiased | Antialiased Before | Antialiased After\r\n-|-|-\r\n![Screenshot_20250407_181646](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f0854dfc-d5e8-4138-909f-da8520392997) | ![Screenshot_20250407_181659](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6b7baf09-88f4-4962-bf1b-6684978c6a0d) | ![Screenshot_20250407_181714](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a2be92b-213c-4918-9a91-152b4894c83c)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105122/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105122/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}